## **Early Access & Memberships**

To get the absolute best prices before stock runs out, having early access is crucial.

*   **Amazon Prime Day:** This is an exclusive sale for Amazon Prime members. A Prime membership is mandatory to view and purchase these deals. If you aren't a member, you can get a Prime membership for ₹999.
*   **Flipkart GOAT Sale:** Early access starts on **July 3, 2026**, for Flipkart Plus and VIP/Black members. You can currently get a 3-month Flipkart Black membership for just ₹399 to secure early access and premium benefits.

